{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_http_backends_fastify_fastifybackend", "label": "FastifyBackend", "file_type": "concept", "rationale": "The default backend and the production recommendation: 150K\u2013200K req/sec on Bun, with the framework's actor-routing overhead the next bottleneck on hot routes.", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/http/backends/fastify.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_http_backends_fastify_bodylimit", "label": "bodyLimit / maxBodyBytes (1 MiB gemeinsamer Cap)", "file_type": "rationale", "rationale": "The one setting the framework fixes for you: 1 MiB across Fastify, Express and Hono, so which requests are accepted no longer depends on the backend; an explicit value still wins.", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/http/backends/fastify.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_http_backends_fastify_withsecurityheaders", "label": "withSecurityHeaders (pro Server)", "file_type": "rationale", "rationale": "Configured per server rather than per backend \u2014 one surface instead of three; every backend-written response carries X-Content-Type-Options nosniff, including the error mapping, the fallback 404 and the 413, which no middleware ever sees.", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/http/backends/fastify.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_http_backends_fastify_raw_instance", "label": "Zugriff auf die rohe Fastify-Instanz", "file_type": "concept", "rationale": "The escape hatch for plugins the DSL does not expose (JWT, swagger, CORS, compression); register route-claiming plugins before binding actor-ts routes when paths overlap.", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/http/backends/fastify.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_http_backends_fastify_lifecycle", "label": "Fastify-Backend-Lifecycle", "file_type": "concept", "rationale": "Fastify.close() drains in-flight requests before resolving, which matches the service-unbind phase of coordinated shutdown.", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/http/backends/fastify.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_http_backends_fastify_bundled_dependency", "label": "Fastify als feste Dependency", "file_type": "concept", "rationale": "Ships with the framework, while the Express and Hono backends are optional peer dependencies installed on demand.", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/http/backends/fastify.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}], "edges": [{"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_http_backends_fastify_fastifybackend", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_http_backends_fastify_bodylimit", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/http/backends/fastify.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_http_backends_fastify_fastifybackend", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_http_backends_fastify_withsecurityheaders", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/http/backends/fastify.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_http_backends_fastify_raw_instance", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_http_backends_fastify_fastifybackend", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/http/backends/fastify.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight":